doctype html
html
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Set your password
  body(style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#ffffff; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;")

    table(width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0")
      tr
        td(align="center" style="padding:40px 16px;")

          table(width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border:1px solid #eee; border-radius:8px;")
            tr
              td(style="padding:32px; text-align:center;")

                h1(style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:24px; color:#f3a4e4; font-weight:600;")
                  | Welcome to Sohnic!

                p(style="margin:0 0 24px; font-size:16px; color:#000;")
                  | Follow this link to set up your password &lt;3

                a(
                  href=`${link}/api/v1/auth/set-password/${token}`
                  style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; background-color:#ffc6f3; color:#000; text-decoration:none; border-radius:6px; font-size:16px; font-weight:500;"
                )
                  | Setup your password

                p(style="margin:32px 0 0; font-size:14px; color:#000;")
                  | Please note that the link expires in 24 hours, complete the set up before this.
